# Runtime logs — bind-mounted host dir (GATEWAY_LOG_DIR), not repo content.
# `*.log` below covers the rotated text logs but NOT logs/vosk_dump/*.raw,
# which is a 16 kHz mono PCM dump and reached 44 MB in one afternoon. An
# unignored binary in a gitignored-shaped directory is exactly what `git add -A`
# picks up.
logs/

